	•	AI Model Architecture: Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)
	•	Algorithm Name: 3-D U-Net–based CT segmentation with multivariate logistic regression for DCC prediction
	•	Input Variables (Data Modality): Imaging (CT/CXR/Echo), Tabular (EMR/Clinical data), Donor metrics
	•	Comparator / Standard of Care: None
